{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/8268e1c80751226084d4a7c276993932.webp?t=1755670680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as the ultimate sci-fi blockbuster has spiraled into an uncontrollable real-life crisis and now it's up to you to salvage the production, protect the crew and locals, and stop what was a cinematic dream from becoming a total disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/f2fda931608356cbd2f8b769b055f516.avif?t=1755670680\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge as the chaos rises around you. The scripted alien invasion has somehow become terrifyingly real: robots have turned rogue, practical effects are out of control, and experimental technology now threatens not just the film but the entire ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate emergency teams, and calm panicked actors while battling sandstorms, quicksand, electrical anomalies and other hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/81b06d2f122237cee2abefcb6847780a.avif?t=1755670680\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tempers flare and egos explode, betrayal brews behind the scenes. Someone has gone too far and they\u2019re now threatening to sabotage the entire project. Can you expose the truth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/276d996befbdda4edd3b897e5ee3608e.webp?t=1755670680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rescue Team: Lights. Camera. Outer Space, as in any time management game, you\u2019ll need to carefully plan your time for building, gathering resources, and using bonuses at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a wide variety of buildings and unique items. Collect them to complete tasks and take part in exciting adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a team of rescuers, take on diverse missions to save people and animals, restore buildings, extinguish fires \u2014 and most importantly, uncover what really happened on the movie set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/9483246dc35ddcd34242b5cf181499ec.avif?t=1755670680\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/3382f4a68459c146536defdcfc79fd9d.webp?t=1755670680\" width=600 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 levels to complete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step-by-step level guide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy downloadable Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful desktop wallpapers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade equipment, level up heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the film reels for the Editing Room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904710/extras/5791b93a20234a64fb5a88a2d91cf3db.avif?t=1755670680\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chief Electrician!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3904710/e74b8afe409f47216d5a50948b923e321e60456e.jpg"},{"name":"Demolisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcom